            "kind": "source_text",
            "content": "THIS WEEK'S WEATHER IN GREENHAVEN\nYour five-day forecast - plan your week and enjoy it!\n\nMonday: sunny, 21 degrees C\nTuesday: cloudy, 17 degrees C\nWednesday: windy, 15 degrees C\nThursday: rainy, 13 degrees C\nFriday: sunny, 22 degrees C\n\nDon't forget your umbrella on Thursday!\nIt is a little cool in the middle of the week, so take a warm jacket.\n\nWEEKEND OUTLOOK\nSaturday and Sunday look warm and sunny. A perfect weekend to be outside!\nHave a lovely week, Greenhaven. See you next Monday for a new forecast.",
